{
    "title": "BrandBee: Surveys & Gift Cards",
    "description": "Welcome to BrandBee\u00ae, previous Mobile Performance Meter. BrandBee is the ultimate rewards app that lets you earn real gift cards just from taking surveys. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf81 Earn Free Gift Cards by Taking Surveys\r\nUnlock a world of rewards by sharing your opinions through our paid surveys. We value your insights and want to reward you for your time via gift cards. Complete surveys and watch your points stack up, bringing you one step closer to free gift cards. Plus, with BrandBee, you can easily redeem these points for gift cards from a wide selection of popular brands, like Amazon, Apple, Sephora, Walmart, Xbox, and more. \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Daily Points for More Rewards!\r\nBrandBee members enjoy daily points just for using the app. Easily accumulate more points to unlock additional rewards! These reward points are just like normal points and can be used towards any gift card of your choosing.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaePlay Games & Earn More\r\nLove to play games? Turn playtime into rewards! BrandBee lets you download and discover a library of casual games. Rack up points while you have fun, and redeem them for exciting gift cards!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Access Coupons for Leading Brands and Stay Updated with the Latest Deals\r\nLooking for coupons, discounts, promo codes, and deals? BrandBee provides you with access to a variety of coupons to top-tier brands, helping you save big on everyday purchases, whether it's groceries, fashion, electronics, or more.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Get Cash Back Rewards When You Shop\r\nLove shopping? Like cash back apps? Then BrandBee is the shopping and cash back app for you! Shop from your favorite brands through the app and earn cash back rewards in the form of points, which can be redeemed for exciting gift cards.\r\n\r\nYour opinions matter, and your savings count. Discover the power of BrandBee \u2013 your ultimate rewards app!\r\n\r\nDownload BrandBee now and start saving today!\r\n\r\nWant to learn more about BrandBee? Check out our website and Facebook!\r\n\r\nhttps://www.brandbee.io/\r\n\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/BrandBee-111367398444712\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude4fWe value your privacy\ud83d\ude4f\r\n\r\nWe do NOT collect user IDs or passwords. If you want more information, please visit our website to view the privacy policy and learn more.\r\n\r\nYour privacy and the protection of your personal data is important to us. We have implemented industry-standard technical and organizational precautions to protect the confidentiality, security, and integrity of your personal data and to prevent any unauthorized use of such personal data. Please review our Privacy Policy for more information with respect to how we process and safeguard your personal data.\r\n\r\nThis app uses Accessibility services.\r\n\r\nBrandBee\u00ae uses the Accessibility Services to gather certain information about you including which websites you visit, your app usage, your online searches, the advertisements you see, and your shopping activities. These everyday online activities help marketers understand the way you experience brands online so they can enhance the way you experience their brand in your everyday life. You may already be sharing this information with social media platforms, search engines, and online retailers - the difference is that BrandBee rewards you for it.\r\n\r\nAll information processed in connection with the Accessibility Services will be processed in accordance with our Privacy Policy.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to BrandBee\u00ae, previous Mobile Performance Meter. BrandBee is the ultimate rewards app that lets you earn real gift cards just from taking surveys. <br><br>\ud83c\udf81 Earn Free Gift Cards by Taking Surveys<br>Unlock a world of rewards by sharing your opinions through our paid surveys. We value your insights and want to reward you for your time via gift cards. Complete surveys and watch your points stack up, bringing you one step closer to free gift cards. Plus, with BrandBee, you can easily redeem these points for gift cards from a wide selection of popular brands, like Amazon, Apple, Sephora, Walmart, Xbox, and more. <br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Daily Points for More Rewards!<br>BrandBee members enjoy daily points just for using the app. Easily accumulate more points to unlock additional rewards! These reward points are just like normal points and can be used towards any gift card of your choosing.<br><br>\ud83c\udfaePlay Games &amp; Earn More<br>Love to play games? Turn playtime into rewards! BrandBee lets you download and discover a library of casual games. Rack up points while you have fun, and redeem them for exciting gift cards!<br><br>\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f Access Coupons for Leading Brands and Stay Updated with the Latest Deals<br>Looking for coupons, discounts, promo codes, and deals? BrandBee provides you with access to a variety of coupons to top-tier brands, helping you save big on everyday purchases, whether it&#39;s groceries, fashion, electronics, or more.<br><br>\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Get Cash Back Rewards When You Shop<br>Love shopping? Like cash back apps? Then BrandBee is the shopping and cash back app for you! Shop from your favorite brands through the app and earn cash back rewards in the form of points, which can be redeemed for exciting gift cards.<br><br>Your opinions matter, and your savings count. Discover the power of BrandBee \u2013 your ultimate rewards app!<br><br>Download BrandBee now and start saving today!<br><br>Want to learn more about BrandBee? Check out our website and Facebook!<br><br>https://www.brandbee.io/<br><br>Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BrandBee-111367398444712<br><br>\ud83d\ude4fWe value your privacy\ud83d\ude4f<br><br>We do NOT collect user IDs or passwords. If you want more information, please visit our website to view the privacy policy and learn more.<br><br>Your privacy and the protection of your personal data is important to us. We have implemented industry-standard technical and organizational precautions to protect the confidentiality, security, and integrity of your personal data and to prevent any unauthorized use of such personal data. Please review our Privacy Policy for more information with respect to how we process and safeguard your personal data.<br><br>This app uses Accessibility services.<br><br>BrandBee\u00ae uses the Accessibility Services to gather certain information about you including which websites you visit, your app usage, your online searches, the advertisements you see, and your shopping activities. These everyday online activities help marketers understand the way you experience brands online so they can enhance the way you experience their brand in your everyday life. You may already be sharing this information with social media platforms, search engines, and online retailers - the difference is that BrandBee rewards you for it.<br><br>All information processed in connection with the Accessibility Services will be processed in accordance with our Privacy Policy.",
